This repository contains derivative work of the following projects:

- vLLM (https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm), Apache License 2.0.
  patches/patched_tree.diff and patches/fp8kv_wiring.diff are modifications
  of vLLM source files as shipped in the lazymio/vllm-backport v0.13.1 image.

- nickus/vllm-fp8kv (https://github.com/nickus/vllm-fp8kv), Apache License 2.0.
  The software FP8 decode technique and the `_decode_fp8e4m3` function in
  patches/fp8kv_wiring.diff are adapted from that project's
  patches/triton_mla_sparse_fp8.patch. This repository re-targets it to the
  NoPE (qk_rope_head_dim = 0) layout (528-byte pages) and adds a write path.

- wtdcode/vllm-backport (https://github.com/wtdcode/vllm-backport).
  Runtime base image and model support for Ampere.

patches/patched_tree.diff additionally contains the net effect of upstream vLLM pull requests
#56525 (state-block commit fence) and a hand-port of #56524 (zero Mamba state blocks on allocation),
authored by datacrystals and contributed to vLLM under the Apache License 2.0. Other pull requests
referenced in the README were only dry-run and are not included.
